"孽。"

#: scenario:scenario_4658E743_4327_4AE0_A0D6_F4ED2C05ED7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c8aca6a1e70b73502c316cc85410c6c29b00349d55171f8f56195875eb235f7
#. default-sha256: fbee0a0b6a7da66e29cfd41aa229c9da7e85455bc74e68c4a43508741ad6e074
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4658E743_4327_4AE0_A0D6_F4ED2C05ED7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My transgression is that I was unable to completely predict where this path we were "
"traveling led."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……是的，⟪k:1⟫名为「未能预料到后果」的罪孽。"

#: scenario:scenario_F421FEF6_8212_4F76_902F_126E652CBBA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baf3b7ada6328a76b8e4f51acbd54fc9e195b240aabdebd8e90ff57fe2a0d584
#. default-sha256: fa4064fca432fd8a7406b62cdc4ee66a0fe68ae066a91062c06294bebd566cc1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F421FEF6_8212_4F76_902F_126E652CBBA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My hands were full dealing with my immediate day-to-day tasks, ⟪k:1⟫so I could do naught but "
"pray there was happiness waiting in the future."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫当时的下仆正为琐碎的事而忙得不可开交。⟪k:1⟫下仆只是祈祷着馆里的人们能幸福地生活下去，"

#: scenario:scenario_04CA1AB7_ED67_44C2_99D6_240B21119DA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 279e02c0fcfd50c982724a9ffe548fe478e6db94fbb1e912f00fedcf29875954
#. default-sha256: 09935e839f5f973c1e18117836fc51c0c9040fe39cf938df6e3e08e097cced5c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_04CA1AB7_ED67_44C2_99D6_240B21119DA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Happiness for everyone who lived within Rose Manor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……居住在蔷薇之馆里的人，⟪k:1⟫抑或所有人都能获得幸福。"

#: scenario:scenario_74D191F3_BB97_4584_A235_BF0E0F8B6ADA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e6ff07f80b4a68080d2333377a495bdf3bb8978c75e4a8cab801403f9ed30dc
#. default-sha256: 447c6464f52a3759a18e7f906b92e0152c8babf2a1e22dd794d4e4fcb6d9d81d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_74D191F3_BB97_4584_A235_BF0E0F8B6ADA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I am but a mere maid. ⟪k:1⟫There are limits to what I am allowed to do. ⟪k:2⟫And "
"furthermore, it was not my place to offer her my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫可下仆只是一介卑微的女仆……⟪k:1⟫对职责外的事无能为力。⟪k:2⟫更何况……引导那名少女，⟪k:3⟫也并非下"
"仆的义务。"

#: scenario:scenario_AAA2349C_6637_4436_A69F_0E7A3C2D9015
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ff9574ba3d6f7ccc8c2fa99b0c9b9d801224726fab5da015c0dcca481fc1e9b
#. default-sha256: c0483203bd69934bf2f0301f4ff3c9cd8891322605de64c47da3463cea57f42a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AAA2349C_6637_4436_A69F_0E7A3C2D9015"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Roads, such as the one we were following, have a way of diverging with little warning."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但下仆我也察觉到，⟪k:1⟫一切正朝着未知的方向急速转变着。"

#: scenario:scenario_887020DA_B005_43BF_A41A_0E9FBBA7E143
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 770b1704dca75c5bf8187d8f5cfc1a48cfd96af1431bdb15c4494289ba5985f7
#. default-sha256: 659db1212ed1a00ed497d40b3044685114c7ae063242d60d88e3e265152e2bf3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_887020DA_B005_43BF_A41A_0E9FBBA7E143"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And if you do not turn the wheel exactly right at those sudden forks, you may end up "
"somewhere horribly off course. ⟪k:1⟫I was well aware of that fact..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……当事态发生变化时，⟪k:1⟫如果弄错了掌舵的方向，⟪k:2⟫那么情况一定会急转直下，不可预料。⟪k:3⟫下"
"仆深知这一点。⟪k:4⟫所以当时——"

#: scenario:scenario_287A7800_5BC1_414D_8DC3_0E3F77FFDDE2
