"to see what she would do next."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫少年没有开口，⟪k:1⟫他只是一动不动地，⟪k:2⟫注视着少女的双眸。⟪k:3⟫像是在告诉她——⟪k:4⟫「我想守"
"护你」。"

#: scenario:scenario_9A1FA805_25C0_4FBE_B920_D55F4E79D37A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f521549b38f8bef6a9d5b91d617021272a8f3f0f3843dd70ec65846175fd60b
