msgid "⟪k:0⟫So please, tell me the reason.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’ll see to it that you’re taken care of..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫请告诉我一切的缘由。⟪k:1⟫我不会做伤害你的事。"

#: scenario:scenario_BCFAD436_5083_44A7_84B9_227F0CE440BC
