msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those are the words of a man of means, Lord Mell.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Of someone blessed enough to have "
"pity for others."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这种话……⟪k:1⟫是因为你不了解才能这么说……梅尔大人。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫因为你不是我所处的世界的人，⟪k:4⟫"
"所以你才体会不到……"

