msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7057D7E3_AA09_4B19_96B6_1163119CB401"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On the night of the storm, I paid a visit to Rose Manor—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫this mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下着暴雨的那个晚上，⟪k:1⟫我…………⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫拜访了这座蔷薇之馆。"

#: scenario:scenario_3A9BA9CB_5CD3_4594_BF21_EF595EEBD26B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1698fe44c91b9f2aafacf251e7a891f4ff2ac0b9834edf56e1479672cd0eb5f
#. default-sha256: 49dab89232636101d0a5d8b5988c2c094e335a613394c5c7140b9d06d2f28c0c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3A9BA9CB_5CD3_4594_BF21_EF595EEBD26B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father and I were always on the move, traveling across the land by foot, so it was only "
"recently that we heard rumors of Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫我也是在之前不久，⟪k:1⟫才听闻蔷薇之馆的传言。⟪k:2⟫那个时候，⟪k:3⟫我和父亲两人相依为命，⟪k:4⟫"
"辗转在各个城市。"

#: scenario:scenario_D7A1F02F_2CD7_4697_A434_2F0479BE1C2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f98a6f2bad52246f935779772d63671c82f2732f189debdb0e3f16ef21a3e2e4
#. default-sha256: 8918df15b9c2c895a5b2461136ae3fcabea33580d1eeab82e9deac98df3e0ef3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D7A1F02F_2CD7_4697_A434_2F0479BE1C2C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There are several reasons we couldn’t stay in one place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫First... ⟪k:3⟫is my "
"unusual appearance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫之所以会流浪……⟪k:1⟫有几个原因。⟪k:2⟫首先……⟪k:3⟫是因为我的外表。"

#: scenario:scenario_2C9D2B32_97EA_4808_BDDA_26140DDEC0AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d3e0efd414f085c2d21a5a7c96170865090b50757b45cfaa18a2264cdf56dc5
#. default-sha256: 0ad4a853effde44ed2d5f7f47972a87cdcc5e79982a0a5f2ddec7dce6d17a301
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2C9D2B32_97EA_4808_BDDA_26140DDEC0AF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫People often find the color of my skin or eyes disconcerting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我的肤色、⟪k:1⟫瞳孔的颜色……⟪k:2⟫经常被人们当做不祥的标志。"

#: scenario:scenario_0428C509_3AD5_41EF_A5FB_CC73F0B3390B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e9b5e716f8a35d1e31cefc88d12a87d73379c870cfbeddeb97a1892dee86571
#. default-sha256: 26947c201a4843d472bf862d5a46da1270489b7bd253163a67425585041096c1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0428C509_3AD5_41EF_A5FB_CC73F0B3390B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So after living in one place for long enough,⟪k:1⟫unsettling rumors would begin to spread, "
"forcing us to leave."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫因此……同一个地方停留的时间久了，⟪k:1⟫不知不觉就会传出中伤和谣言。⟪k:2⟫不得已，⟪k:3⟫我们只能离"
"开。"

#: scenario:scenario_33338E74_9745_4C04_A155_FF439B5330F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cade5c61deab65f66b1d6c38bda41c0406f328e36c7c33c759c8fdabdfdd0a78
#. default-sha256: 0949e064554532a82baad24c57f9a32246d09879d51c121d14cd6fb039f07909
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_33338E74_9745_4C04_A155_FF439B5330F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Another reason... ⟪k:1⟫was my father’s line of work.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He painted pictures for a "
"living."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫然后，⟪k:1⟫是因为我父亲的工作性质。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫他是一名画家，⟪k:4⟫以此维生。"

#: scenario:scenario_1A9D5305_ED42_4671_9F56_10D0C3532AE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ba2e23017b8398b8242b00dff02b44f2da5fc9ee6ddfff2fd4092f825f3062c
#. default-sha256: 640df9305396b8267fdd9abfe476099a371db1c2bc7f7e3dd55d293096c644cb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1A9D5305_ED42_4671_9F56_10D0C3532AE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had trouble finding a patron, so he had to work day-to-day...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When he was no "
"longer able to find work in a city, we would move."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫但迟迟找不到愿意资助父亲创作活动的人，⟪k:1⟫只能靠着杯水车薪度日……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫当在一个城市里无法"
"找到工作时，⟪k:4⟫我们就不得不去别的地方。"

#: scenario:scenario_575B60BC_BB37_4475_8BA8_6814A80488A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66cf8eb89dd8152a20cf4b6d2c0eaabad9de930f114d06b03c51c697a68af344
#. default-sha256: 4a9e02bde5abd3c6c2cabd1ea905ad9cbc623be02deef5a45e72dddb9f4e0d1e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_575B60BC_BB37_4475_8BA8_6814A80488A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We were birds that migrated without a flock."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我们就像是孤独的候鸟。⟪k:1⟫永远找不到停息之处。"

#: scenario:scenario_4A09487B_5B8F_4949_B006_58FCF7D98D50
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9f29ced2b3887d6bf576c77e00bb7fc8683f5259f62102afcb52f2443298aab
#. default-sha256: 9c6ce6186ffa83be4c8106223e03d3b21f7996b916a371ad68ab712564053151
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4A09487B_5B8F_4949_B006_58FCF7D98D50"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When we arrived at this town, my father was exhausted and weak.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That is when we "
"learned of Rose Manor..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……来到这座城市的时候，⟪k:1⟫父亲的身体已经非常衰弱了。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫得知蔷薇之馆的存在，⟪k:4⟫就是"
"在那时。"

#: scenario:scenario_3019C590_EF86_450D_A610_9FC45A26E841
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d578d8273fe9d10548047e5d280dc9f458c77e9e89fd0f1d5cc06cef5ac6627
#. default-sha256: f15cf088f9893f5e9a2bf5fd60f9a63079816883fd2df1d7bb22c827bfcb4b96
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3019C590_EF86_450D_A610_9FC45A26E841"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and the family who dwelled within it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Rhodes is a name my father could never forget."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫——住着「罗兹家族」所居住的「蔷薇之馆」……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫对父亲而言是个无法忘记的名字吧。"

#: scenario:scenario_2801E4E0_E4EC_488C_B0DF_A8D80C68CB0D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a9706e8a4828b3649ed745b77779d7bdc66342cad753eb2c664179aa030d98d
#. default-sha256: 25a61dda877d8409d00c6dc5ef18a2092361627f73acae199a4f29299f91e946
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2801E4E0_E4EC_488C_B0DF_A8D80C68CB0D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was, long ago, a painter in service of the Rhodes family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫因为父亲他在很早以前……⟪k:1⟫曾经是罗兹家的御用画师。"

#: scenario:scenario_5D6D71B4_BFAE_4E86_91AC_8292A38DAFF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 512617d717bb8a6a32027d9178854f75ba634441139b025e85fb03cbdace6b26
#. default-sha256: a7619529c2a50563ea6f91f52ad50ac8ed92b94b89449475c6dcc24fca97b760
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5D6D71B4_BFAE_4E86_91AC_8292A38DAFF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫H-⟪k:1⟫Hold on...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Your father was an artist here?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫等、⟪k:1⟫等一下……⟪k:2⟫你的父亲，曾经是我们家的私人画师！？"

#: scenario:scenario_5E34BE8D_9DC7_471B_ACDF_7167EECA3526
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6e85e63c4f507faac1bc64ff611eeb209b4b1aee264689e5d047673a592f8d2
#. default-sha256: ada0d2524c04e663e860ae8a6782638a8332afa90b8be54994f6de2f702fdbfe
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5E34BE8D_9DC7_471B_ACDF_7167EECA3526"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Yes.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was before I was born, so you probably don’t remember, Lord Mell."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……是的。⟪k:1⟫但那已经是在我出生前的事了……⟪k:2⟫所以梅尔大人自然也不知道。"

