msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father’s paintings were no less skillful!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫His was a talent that could not be "
"easily imitated!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫明明我父亲的作品是那么出色！⟪k:1⟫他人又怎能轻易模仿得出父亲的画技之高超！"

#: scenario:scenario_915E5451_8083_472C_8693_C47ACEFE7ED5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef60b8a6240416a984b5626dd3f2d868f969d624664718a2817f1983096638ad
