msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Rhodes family stole everything from my father.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But even thrown out onto the "
"streets, his only skill was painting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是罗兹家……夺走了父亲的一切。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫即便如此父亲也只能继续画下去。"

#: scenario:scenario_571CF3A2_CEFA_4E6C_B91D_1E24807F6603
