#: scenario:scenario_31E38DAE_533E_41D5_88DF_D96EA452F213
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04f55fef119e2099416d80d1c450f127a26f250c259e35af8de0fdf8227f0625
