msgstr "⟪k:0⟫直到咽下最后一口气前……⟪k:1⟫他还在担心着我……"

#: scenario:scenario_CD6E291F_755C_4BE7_B15C_D83003B2EADE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
