"⟪k:0⟫I disdained the Rhodes family for putting us...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, for putting my father through "
"such hardship."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……我憎恨罗兹家。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫憎恨将我们……⟪k:3⟫将父亲逼入如此境地的人们……"

#: scenario:scenario_472740DE_ED88_4671_9470_93460F18559C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b8ac578c0e37ce1b0e7f6c4381af25f711a09cfbb825e3aff61960fced25ed1
