"⟪k:0⟫I imagined you were still living in decadence,⟪k:1⟫acting as though nothing had ever "
"happened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫你们一直都过着幸福美满的生活。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫所有人都早已不记得我父亲的事，⟪k:3⟫更不在乎他。"

#: scenario:scenario_2E8B6A2C_E63A_40F1_AC64_11E4AF5DCA1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6fa12afb1e9ee74bf57f0a9fe76a51f136b64001a3e48fff1f31fbaff0d43971
