msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他告诉了下仆事情的原委，⟪k:1⟫委托下仆寻找能让她看上去端庄得体的衣裳。"

#: scenario:scenario_B636FE98_E51B_4325_83D6_2944F597A7AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60559176cb52f9abf23a3749c2c100967e5135ba2193d0c1c7ccd1e3624a9500
